%% Booking lifecycle — rendered to booking-flow.svg by .github/workflows/visual-docs.yml
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant A as /api/bookings
  participant D as Neon Postgres
  participant S as Stripe
  participant O as Operator

  C->>A: Book operator for a job (date, hours, total)
  A->>D: Operator verified? checkOperatorAvailability()
  Note over A,D: weekly windows, blocked dates,<br/>exclusion constraint against overlaps
  A->>D: job open → booked, insert booking (pending)
  A->>S: PaymentIntent, manual capture (authorize only)
  A-->>C: Booking request sent
  alt Operator confirms
    O->>A: Confirm
    A->>D: Re-check availability, booking → confirmed
    O->>A: Complete (after the flight)
    A->>S: Capture, then transfer 85% to operator (15% platform fee)
    A->>D: booking → completed, job → completed, payout_status
  else Operator declines
    O->>A: Decline
    A->>S: Cancel PaymentIntent
    A->>D: booking → cancelled, job → open
  end
